From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hans2294 <22217531+hans2294@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 10:06:53 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] haiku-gl: direct mode straight into the frame buffer

A BGLView in a BDirectWindow imports the CRTC's scanout buffer as an
EGLImage through a dma-buf and blits each frame into it on the GPU,
clipped to what DirectConnected() reports. Also: dmabuf caps on Haiku,
and WSI implicit sync only for images that have a dma-buf.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
